+     * caller). Any thread, any time (cheap: a few loads and a copy).
+     * key_name: canonical name of a key code (its US place), NULL if unknown.
+     * key_label: UTF-8 text of the key on the active layout, written to out (cap bytes,
+     * NUL-terminated); returns its length, 0 for an unknown code. */
