+ * double divide cost ~11% of THP8's render thread with the tracer on (rt1sync_clean act xprof: ntdll QPC 6.1% +
+ * frame_trace_now_us 4.9%), which skewed every bench run with PS3_SPIKE_MS. On x86-64 Windows the clock is the
+ * TSC (invariant on every CPU this runs on; QPC reads it too), calibrated once against QPC when the tracer turns
