+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Host-side texture replacement (rsx_texrepl.c). A cache entry is keyed when
+ * its guest data is decoded (new entry, or the content hash changed); a hit
+ * stores the record in entry->repl. Each bind asks rsx_texrepl for the
+ * replacement and points the entry's SRV at it once it is resident, or back at
+ * the guest texture while it loads / after an eviction. The guest decode still
+ * runs: it is the 1x fallback, and the content-change detector stays on it.
+ * -----------------------------------------------------------------------*/
