+ * ps3recomp - host-side texture replacement (see rsx_texrepl.h)
+ *
+ * Flow:
+ *   startup   texrepl_init(): scan <mods>/textures and <mods>/<pack>/textures for
+ *             <16 hex>.dds -> key -> record table (open-addressed hash). Nothing is
+ *             read from the files yet.
