+ *             detector) changes: texrepl_find() -> record id or -1.
+ *   bind      texrepl_acquire(): first use of a record queues it for a loader
+ *             thread and the guest texture is used meanwhile (1x fallback). The
+ *             loader reads + validates the DDS and creates the D3D12 texture and a
+ *             filled UPLOAD buffer (ID3D12Device is free-threaded). The next bind on
+ *             the render thread records the copies + one barrier and samples the
+ *             replacement from then on.
+ *   frame     texrepl_frame(): LRU eviction over the resident budget (records not
+ *             drawn for TR_EVICT_IDLE = 120 frames; an evicted record reloads on its
+ *             next use), stale loaded-but-unused uploads dropped, dump flush, stats.
