+ *   LLIN  GETLLAR line: new content restarts the count, known content is
+ *         neutral; remembered as the line to park on
+ *   SYNC  a committed PUTLLC / PUTLLUC: the line becomes known content; too
+ *         many of them between two GETs is atomic work (see above)
+ *   OUT   a plain PUT: rewriting known content is not output; new content
+ *         restarts the count */
