+                    " armed-watch hits ppu %.0f/s spu %.0f/s | ppu cellSyncMutexLock %.0f/s contended %.0f/s"
+                    " spin %.2f ms/s, lanes parked during spin 0:%.0f%% 1:%.0f%% 2:%.0f%% 3+:%.0f%%\n",
