+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Operand shaping. On top of the random state, the operands of an
+ * instruction class are drawn from the edges that class is sensitive to:
+ * shufb control-byte classes, quadword/word/halfword shift counts (0, 1..15,
+ * 16+, negative, high garbage bits), SP specials (zero exponent, exponent 255,
+ * overflow, underflow, cancellation for the fused forms, cross products for
+ * the compares), conversion scale edges, DP ties / cancellation / denormals /
+ * NaN, carries and compare neighbours. Seeds that are not shaped stay fully
+ * random. Deterministic per (case, seed).
+ * ------------------------------------------------------------------------ */
